    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Each **ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER** unit with this ability has its own **psyker level**, 1 or more, given in its abilities. The name of each **psychic ability** gives that ability's **psychic level**, which is also 1 or more.\n\nIn each battle round, an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER** unit of yours can use any mix of **psychic abilities** whose combined **psychic level** is at most its **psyker level**.",
